{"content_hash": "f70704162dd092a5", "version_id": 951, "article_id": 96, "level_code": "en_a1", "lang": "en", "level": 1, "level_label": "A1 入门", "title": "Nvidia boss Jensen Huang leaves after 33 years", "title_zh": "执掌33年后，英伟达CEO黄仁勋辞职", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1689249?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542744095-fcf48d80b0fd?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fGNlb3xlbnwwfDB8fHwxNzk0NTM1MzI4fDA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Campaign Creators on Unsplash", "author": "Campaign Creators", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@campaign_creators?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/people-sitting-near-table-with-laptop-computer-qCi_MzVODoU?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(76, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(114, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "04848d0d90e2"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-13", "word_count": 72, "reading_minutes": 0.4, "lead": "Jensen Huang started Nvidia in 1993. On November 12, he left the company. The CFO will lead Nvidia for now.", "lead_zh": "黄仁勋于1993年创办英伟达。11月12日，他离开了这家公司。目前由首席财务官暂时接管。", "preview": "Nvidia said Huang left his job as CEO. He also left the board. The change started right away.", "preview_zh": "英伟达表示，黄仁勋辞去CEO一职，同时也离开了董事会。这一变动立即生效。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 934, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a1.mp3", "duration": 28.125, "size_bytes": 169776, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 86, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 28.6, "size_bytes": 172512, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 86, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 30.925, "size_bytes": 186480, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 86, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 26.4, "size_bytes": 159408, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 86, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/96/en_a1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 28.15, "size_bytes": 169920, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 86, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/96/en_a1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@959f3ce/content/data/versions/951.json", "paragraphs": ["Nvidia said Huang left his job as CEO. He also left the board. The change started right away.", "Colette Kress is now the temporary CEO. She joined Nvidia in 2013. She was the chief financial officer.", "Nvidia will look for a new CEO. Some people talk about Ian Buck. He works on CUDA software.", "Nvidia stock fell 12.5% before the market opened. One share cost $152.00. Investors are worried about the future."], "paragraphs_zh": ["英伟达表示，黄仁勋辞去CEO一职，同时也离开了董事会。这一变动立即生效。", "科莱特·克雷斯现在担任临时CEO。她于2013年加入英伟达，此前担任首席财务官。", "英伟达将寻找新的CEO。有人提到伊恩·巴克，他负责CUDA软件相关业务。", "英伟达股价在盘前交易中下跌12.5%，每股报152.00美元。投资者对公司的未来感到担忧。"], "body": "Nvidia said Huang left his job as CEO. He also left the board. The change started right away.\n\nColette Kress is now the temporary CEO. She joined Nvidia in 2013. She was the chief financial officer.\n\nNvidia will look for a new CEO. Some people talk about Ian Buck. He works on CUDA software.\n\nNvidia stock fell 12.5% before the market opened. One share cost $152.00. Investors are worried about the future.", "body_zh": "英伟达表示，黄仁勋辞去CEO一职，同时也离开了董事会。这一变动立即生效。\n\n科莱特·克雷斯现在担任临时CEO。她于2013年加入英伟达，此前担任首席财务官。\n\n英伟达将寻找新的CEO。有人提到伊恩·巴克，他负责CUDA软件相关业务。\n\n英伟达股价在盘前交易中下跌12.5%，每股报152.00美元。投资者对公司的未来感到担忧。", "text": "Nvidia said Huang left his job as CEO. He also left the board. The change started right away. Colette Kress is now the temporary CEO. She joined Nvidia in 2013. She was the chief financial officer. Nvidia will look for a new CEO. Some people talk about Ian Buck. He works on CUDA software. Nvidia stock fell 12.5% before the market opened. One share cost $152.00. Investors are worried about the future.", "vocab": [{"word": "CEO", "pos": "noun", "zh": "首席执行官", "note": "公司最高负责人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "leave", "pos": "verb", "zh": "离开；辞去", "note": "过去式是 left", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "company", "pos": "noun", "zh": "公司", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "job", "pos": "noun", "zh": "工作；职位", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "temporary", "pos": "adj", "zh": "临时的", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "stock", "pos": "noun", "zh": "股票；股价", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "fall", "pos": "verb", "zh": "下跌", "note": "过去式是 fell", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "future", "pos": "noun", "zh": "未来", "note": "", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-13T02:02:06.272126", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Nvidia", "s": 0.325, "e": 0.75, "sm": 325, "em": 750, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "said", "s": 0.75, "e": 0.925, "sm": 750, "em": 925, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "Huang", "s": 0.925, "e": 1.225, "sm": 925, "em": 1225, "cs": 12, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "left", "s": 1.225, "e": 1.462, "sm": 1225, "em": 1462, "cs": 18, "ce": 22, "si": 0}, 